widthTest is test
widthTest purpose "Check `width` on a 7 by 3 rectangle"
widthTest verifies width returnsWidth
widthTest typeParameter none
widthTest input none
widthTest output none
widthTest outputOwnedBy none
widthTest raises none
widthTest effect none
widthTest uses none
widthTest memoryHeap false
widthTest async false
widthTest maxRecursion none
widthTest label begin loopKind none
widthTest label begin within none
widthTest let seven Int64 7 immutable
widthTest let three Int64 3 immutable
widthTest let twentyOne Int64 21 immutable
widthTest at begin do makeBox
widthTest at begin do runTarget
widthTest at begin do expectValue
widthTest at begin return ok none

makeBox is call
makeBox in widthTest
makeBox invokes Rectangle.new
makeBox argument width Int64 seven copy
makeBox argument height Int64 three copy
makeBox result box Rectangle
makeBox ownedBy none
makeBox cleanedBy none
makeBox borrows none
makeBox catch none

runTarget is call
runTarget in widthTest
runTarget invokes width
runTarget argument shape Rectangle box copy
runTarget result result Int64
runTarget ownedBy none
runTarget cleanedBy none
runTarget borrows none
runTarget catch none

expectValue is call
expectValue in widthTest
expectValue invokes test.assertEqualInt64
expectValue argument expected Int64 seven copy
expectValue argument actual Int64 result copy
expectValue result none
expectValue ownedBy none
expectValue cleanedBy none
expectValue borrows none
expectValue catch none
